{field-2}} |  |  |  |\n|  | {{field-3}} | $-2$ |  |  |  |\n|  | $6$ |  |  |  |  |\n|  | $-5$ |  |  |  |  |" :question/worked-solution "This system can be written as\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}-2 & 0 \\\\ -3 & 4\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}6 \\\\ -5\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nTo find the solution, we need to calculate the inverse of the coefficient matrix \n$A=[\\begin{aligned}-2 & 0 \\\\ -3 & 4\\end{aligned}].$\nThis gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{A}^{-1} & =\\frac{1}{-2\\cdot 4-(-3)\\cdot 0}[\\begin{aligned}4 & 0 \\\\ 3 & -2\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{8}[\\begin{aligned}4 & 0 \\\\ 3 & -2\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe can now represent the solution to this system as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x & ={A}^{-1}b \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{8}[\\begin{aligned}4 & 0 \\\\ 3 & -2\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}6 \\\\ -5\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-320804/field-1" "q-320804/field-2" "q-320804/field-3"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "c89778fa-3c8d-5f0a-a0f8-c9b3d9193ffd"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-320804"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-32136/selection/50221acc1180e9019a68c7c4a6d9c91461b3c0bd22d0e00ab49c0bfa3329c249" :answer/id #uuid "a4896dea-afaf-576b-a304-406bae0e7686" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x=[\\begin{aligned}-3 & -1 \\\\ 2 & -1\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-32136/selection/6b80a6a0c26bc532401778bf86789446f2eac04293dd2ff871b84a8abdbb393f" :answer/id #uuid "3fa38624-85e8-59a3-beed-01bd9c565ba1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x=-\\frac{1}{5}[\\begin{aligned}3 & -1 \\\\ 2 & 1\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-32136/selection/11d4ee1b5c2f0515e5ee0ff5f30ff8d41ed605c4414ce0cc96c26d6b5fa796cc" :answer/id #uuid "6edb44c